ok - protocol: initialize, ping, tools/list, and error codes
ok - send_note: one idempotent note, and firstmate's reply returns
ok - note_replies: newest replies first page, after cursor pages forward
ok - bad input is a tool error, never a note
ok - reads: status, summary, backlog, crew state, and report
ok - ids and symlinks cannot escape the home
ok - authority boundary: reads leave the home byte-identical
ok - missing files are errors
